0:20:12.82 --> 0:20:15.49
Asaka Dougaku Asaka Dougaku

720
0:20:12.82 --> 0:20:15.49
Asaka-san Asaka Midori-san

721
0:20:15.49 --> 0:20:16.24
Мен

722
